+# F1.1 — Stable Room Storage Addon
+
+Date: 2026-11-14 · Base commit: `a316f53`
+
+## Scope delivered
+
+- `storage/room` manifest changed from `planned` to `stable` and `generatable`.
+- Room 2.8.5 with KSP 2.3.10 (no KAPT), KSP and Room Gradle plugins.
+- Generated `NoteEntity`, `NoteDao`, `AppDatabase`, `DatabaseProvider`,
+  `NoteRepository`, plus JVM and instrumented tests.
+- Schema export to `app/schemas/.../1.json`.
+- Conflict with `storage/sqlite-direct`; no remote sync, auth, DI or CRUD UI.
+
+## Validation
+
+| Check | Result |
+| --- | --- |
+| Minimal project build/test/lint | PASS (APK 11,649,414 bytes, 4 tests) |
+| Room project `assembleDebug` | PASS |
+| Room `testDebugUnitTest` | PASS |
+| Room `compileDebugAndroidTestKotlin` | PASS |
+| Room `lintDebug` | PASS |
+| Room schema export | PASS (`app/schemas/.../1.json`) |
+| KSP generated `NoteDao_Impl` | PASS |
+| Catalog/resolver/generator tests | PASS (71 tests, 470 assertions) |
+| Determinism API/CLI | PASS (`5371874e...25672c3` without addon; Room ZIP deterministic) |
+
+## Version correction
+
+KSP 2.3.12 and Kotlin 2.4.10 are not jointly usable with the Compose compiler
+plugin. The template now uses Kotlin/KGP/KSP/Compose 2.3.10, which is the latest
+Kotlin version available to both KSP and Compose. Room 2.8.5 builds successfully.
+EOF
