++# F1.0 — Safe Addon Composition Engine
++
++Date: 2026-11-13 · Base commit: `a316f53`
++
++## Scope delivered
++
++- Typed operations `add`, `insert`, `merge`, with legacy `modify`/`append`
++  rejected at execution.
++- Declared template slots in `settings.gradle.kts`, `build.gradle.kts` and
++  `app/build.gradle.kts`.
++- Structured Gradle and version-catalog merges without global text replacement.
++- Canonical TOML serialization with conflict detection.
++- Operation summaries in `GenerationPlan`.
++- Internal composition fixtures with tests for add, insert, merge, version
++  references, slot contributions, deduplication, conflict, stale slot, protected
++  paths, legacy rejection, atomic failure and order independence.
